  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.0: .NET 11 and C# 15 release. All projects now multi-target net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/net11.0 and build with LangVersion 15, and the package includes net11.0 assemblies for CHDSharpLib and every vendored codec. CLI release bundles now use each platform's native format: .zip on Windows, .tar.gz on Linux and .dmg on macOS. No public API or encoder output changes: 4,220 library tests + 455 encoder tests on each target framework, jb inspectcode 0 findings, quick battle harness 905/905 checks. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/net11.0.",
